---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import ProjectCard from '@/components/ProjectCard.astro'
import { projects } from '@/data/projects'
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main id="main-content" class="min-h-screen">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 via-white to-accent-50 dark:from-primary-950 dark:via-slate-950 dark:to-accent-950"
      >
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-16 text-center">
        <img src="/favicon.svg" width="72" height="72" alt="disinauni" class="mx-auto mb-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg" />

        <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">disinauni</h1>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <strong>Di manapun kita berada, harus selalu belajar agar bisa menikmati proses kehidupan dengan bijak.</strong>
        </p>

        <p class="mt-6 text-base text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Portal belajar coding gratis &amp; interaktif untuk siswa SMP &amp; SMA Indonesia — tanpa akun, tanpa iklan,
          langsung bisa dicoba di browser.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="#proyek"
            class="rounded-full bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 transition-colors"
          >
            Lihat 5 Proyek
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/disinauni"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-primary-400 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-semibold px-6 py-3 transition-colors"
          >
            GitHub Organisasi
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Filosofi -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-center text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Filosofi</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-center text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <strong>Disinauni</strong> berasal dari Bahasa Jawa — bentuk pasif dari <em>sinau</em> (belajar), kira-kira berarti
        "diajari" atau "dibelajarkan".
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">DI</div>
          <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Dimanapun berada</div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">
            Belajar tidak terikat tempat, kelas, atau alat mahal.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">SINAU</div>
          <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Tetap belajar</div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">
            Proses yang tidak pernah selesai, sekecil apapun langkahnya.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">NI</div>
          <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Nikmat urip</div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">
            Menikmati proses kehidupan, bukan sekadar mengejar hasil.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Proyek -->
    <section id="proyek" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-center text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Proyek Kami</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-center text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Lima situs belajar pemrograman, satu arsitektur — kurikulumnya dirancang mengikuti idiom asli tiap bahasa, bukan
        sekadar terjemahan urutan materi.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {projects.map((project) => <ProjectCard project={project} />)}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 py-10">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">Dibuat dengan ❤️ untuk pelajar Indonesia</p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/disinauni"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 hover:text-primary-600 dark:hover:text-primary-400"
        >
          github.com/disinauni
        </a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
